        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you ..\r\n\r\nApartment with mountain views \r\n2 Bedroom , 2 Bathroom,  open plan living \r\nParking / New windows though out they apartment . \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present Apartment 84 The Moyle to the Dublin 11 property market.\r\nApartment 84, The Moyle, Prospect Hill, Finglas Road is a superbly presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment offering bright and spacious accommodation, finished and maintained to the highest standards throughout. Boasting stunning views of the Dublin Mountains and an abundance of natural light, this impressive property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, investors, and those seeking a stylish home in a highly convenient location. Early viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\nUpon arrival, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting entrance hallway which sets the tone for the quality and care evident throughout the property. To the left, you enter the spacious open-plan lounge, kitchen, and dining area. This light-filled living space is enhanced by new floor-to-ceiling windows, allowing natural light to pour in while perfectly framing the impressive views over the Dublin Mountains. The balcony can be accessed directly from the living area, creating the ideal setting for relaxing evenings or entertaining guests. The modern open-plan layout provides both comfort and functionality, making this the true heart of the home.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen has recently been renovated to a high standard and has an abundance of base and eye level storage.\r\n\r\nMoving through the property, the bedroom accommodation comprises two generously proportioned double bedrooms, both complete with fitted wardrobes and large windows which flood the rooms with natural light. The main bedroom further benefits from a stylish ensuite bathroom. A well-appointed family bathroom with quality sanitary ware completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe Moyle is ideally located on Finglas Road, offering residents excellent access to a wealth of local amenities including shops, cafés, schools, parks, and leisure facilities. The Charlestown Shopping Centre and IKEA are both within easy reach, while nearby parks and recreational areas provide excellent outdoor amenities.\r\n\r\nThe area is exceptionally well serviced by public transport, with a number of regular Dublin Bus routes operating nearby, providing quick and convenient access to Dublin City Centre, which is approximately 6km away. The M50 motorway and Dublin Airport are also easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised ..\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
